<title>SOUTH AFRICA: NAIL'S RAMAPHOSA JOINS FNB BOARD.</title>
<headline>NAIL'S RAMAPHOSA JOINS FNB BOARD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Africa Investments Ltd (Nail) deputy executive chairman and ANC former secretary general Cyril Ramaphosa has joined the board of First National Bank Holding Ltd, FNB said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The appointment took effect on November 6 but was only announced in the group's annual report released this week.</p>
<p>University of Cape Town Professor Kate Jowell was also appointed as a member of the board.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
